So usually I will wake up,

00:10:51.093 --> 00:10:52.860
then I will charge it as soon as I get up,

00:10:52.860 --> 00:10:55.890
I will either eat
breakfast or do some email

00:10:55.890 --> 00:10:57.170
and then it's ready to go

00:10:57.170 --> 00:10:58.620
and then I'll start working out with it

00:10:58.620 --> 00:11:00.060
and then I'll just continue on my day.

00:11:00.060 --> 00:11:02.320
But the one thing that
has been really cool is,

00:11:02.320 --> 00:11:04.600
it will give you an alert on your iPhone

00:11:04.600 --> 00:11:07.262
when your Apple Watch is fully charged.

00:11:07.262 --> 00:11:09.845
(upbeat music)

00:11:11.640 --> 00:11:12.880
The coolest thing,

00:11:12.880 --> 00:11:15.560
is the new bike directions in iOS 14

00:11:15.560 --> 00:11:17.550
and paired with the Apple Watch.

00:11:17.550 --> 00:11:18.383
It was amazing.

00:11:18.383 --> 00:11:19.300
I took the whole way here.

00:11:19.300 --> 00:11:20.790
I was able to just look at my watch

00:11:20.790 --> 00:11:22.180
to get my directions

00:11:22.180 --> 00:11:24.510
and I even tracked my bike ride

00:11:24.510 --> 00:11:27.810
5.27 miles, 50 minutes.

00:11:27.810 --> 00:11:29.532
They're still going.

00:11:29.532 --> 00:11:32.090
(breathes heavily) It is so nice outside,

00:11:32.090 --> 00:11:33.573
I love it.

00:11:33.573 --> 00:11:36.156
(upbeat music)

00:11:55.971 --> 00:11:57.460
Here we go, outdoor cycle,

00:11:57.460 --> 00:11:58.600
hour, 26 minutes,

00:11:58.600 --> 00:12:01.970
10.2 miles, average speed 7.1

00:12:01.970 --> 00:12:03.100
I think we've to kind of split these

00:12:03.100 --> 00:12:05.110
in half because the calories

00:12:05.110 --> 00:12:06.840
of, of this ride,

00:12:06.840 --> 00:12:09.560
because my bike is sort of pedal-assist

00:12:09.560 --> 00:12:11.120
but I'm really hungry

00:12:11.120 --> 00:12:13.350
and tired from all of my workouts today

00:12:13.350 --> 00:12:15.420
for you guys for this review.

00:12:15.420 --> 00:12:18.750
Like my legs (mumbling)

00:12:18.750 --> 00:12:19.860
So it's been about two weeks

00:12:19.860 --> 00:12:20.700
with the Apple Watch

00:12:20.700 --> 00:12:22.210
and obviously it's no surprise.

00:12:22.210 --> 00:12:23.350
You guys know I'm such a huge fan

00:12:23.350 --> 00:12:24.650
of the Apple Watch and this one

00:12:24.650 --> 00:12:26.350
of course is no exception.

00:12:26.350 --> 00:12:27.230
So what have I been doing

00:12:27.230 --> 00:12:28.380
for the past couple of weeks?

00:12:28.380 --> 00:12:29.550
Well, I've been challenging some

00:12:29.550 --> 00:12:31.550
of my friends to do
some fitness activities

00:12:31.550 --> 00:12:33.140
and that's one of my most favorite things.

00:12:33.140 --> 00:12:35.810
Being able to really see
what my friends are up

00:12:35.810 --> 00:12:38.260
to and have that kind
of friendly competition

00:12:38.260 --> 00:12:41.060
to go that extra few
steps to close your rings.

00:12:41.060 --> 00:12:42.800
And I have to say,

00:12:42.800 --> 00:12:44.680
that Marquez has beat me yet again

00:12:44.680 --> 00:12:46.390
and most of the time it's because

00:12:46.390 --> 00:12:49.140
I have not closed my stand goal,

00:12:49.140 --> 00:12:50.740
and that makes me really sad.

00:12:50.740 --> 00:12:52.900
I've been spending a lot
of time editing(chuckles)

00:12:52.900 --> 00:12:54.100
The best part about it is now

00:12:54.100 --> 00:12:56.400
I've actually been using
this to track my sleep.

00:12:56.400 --> 00:12:57.233
My favorite part though,

00:12:57.233 --> 00:12:58.540
about the sleep tracking is,

00:12:58.540 --> 00:13:00.740
the gentle haptic feedback that I get

00:13:00.740 --> 00:13:02.670
in the morning when my alarm goes off.

00:13:02.670 --> 00:13:03.800
And I almost feel like

00:13:03.800 --> 00:13:05.340
the past couple of weeks,

00:13:05.340 --> 00:13:07.480
I have been waking up feeling much more

00:13:07.480 --> 00:13:09.770
refreshed because you don't wake up

00:13:09.770 --> 00:13:12.240
with this crazy loud alarm just blaring.

00:13:12.240 --> 00:13:16.870
It's just like a gentle tap on your wrist,

00:13:16.870 --> 00:13:18.500
I wake up, I like,

00:13:18.500 --> 00:13:20.320
I hit snooze for a second,

00:13:20.320 --> 00:13:22.650
and then I go back to
sleep for a few seconds

00:13:22.650 --> 00:13:23.483
and then it's like,

00:13:23.483 --> 00:13:25.860
"Hey, you're still sleeping."

00:13:25.860 --> 00:13:26.870
And that's when I get up.

00:13:26.870 --> 00:13:28.580
I think if you do have
an Apple Watch older

00:13:28.580 --> 00:13:30.180
than the Series five or the Series four

00:13:30.180 --> 00:13:31.013
that's where you're gonna

00:13:31.013 --> 00:13:31.846
really see the difference.

00:13:31.846 --> 00:13:33.297
You also see a difference
with the charging

00:13:33.297 --> 00:13:35.410
all in all, I think the
most important thing

00:13:35.410 --> 00:13:36.810
is being able to have these heart

00:13:36.810 --> 00:13:38.140
tracking features just to be able

00:13:38.140 --> 00:13:39.710
to get that consistent baseline of

00:13:39.710 --> 00:13:40.680
what is your heart rate.

00:13:40.680 --> 00:13:41.890
I think that's really one

00:13:41.890 --> 00:13:43.090
of the most important things.

00:13:43.090 --> 00:13:44.340
If you guys have any other questions

00:13:44.340 --> 00:13:46.240
about this Apple Watch
or anything in general,

00:13:46.240 --> 00:13:48.160
feel free to leave those
in the comments below.

00:13:48.160 --> 00:13:49.870
I look forward to doing a follow-up video,

00:13:49.870 --> 00:13:51.530
answering any of your questions

00:13:51.530 --> 00:13:53.300
and talking more about

00:13:53.300 --> 00:13:54.800
my love for the Apple Watch.

00:13:54.800 --> 00:13:56.700
Maybe I'll come back and be so,

00:13:56.700 --> 00:14:00.440
just strong that I will
just pick up this table

00:14:00.440 --> 00:14:01.970
and throw it and you'll be like,

00:14:01.970 --> 00:14:04.290
Wow, she's strong.

00:14:04.290 --> 00:14:07.810
She works out with the
Apple Watch (chuckles)

00:14:08.693 --> 00:14:10.200
not only when Apple fitness comes out.

00:14:10.200 --> 00:14:11.409
Look out!

00:14:11.409 --> 00:14:13.992
(upbeat music)

